{"ref":"BDB, עָכָן","hw":"עָכָן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָכָן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> man of Judah;—<a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:1\" href=\"/Joshua.7.1\">Jos 7:1</a> (P), v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:18\" href=\"/Joshua.7.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:19\" href=\"/Joshua.7.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:20\" href=\"/Joshua.7.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:24\" href=\"/Joshua.7.24\">24</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:20\" href=\"/Joshua.22.20\">22:20</a> (P); = <span dir=\"rtl\">עָכָר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.7\">1 Ch 2:7</a> (from <span dir=\"rtl\">עָבוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:26\" href=\"/Joshua.7.26\">Jos 7:26</a>, v. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, עָכָר\" href=\"/BDB,_עָכָר\", dir=\"rtl\">עָכָר</a>); Αχαρ, Αχαν.","next":"BDB, יַעְכָּן²","prev":"BDB, עכן"}